    "detailed_description": "<h1>NEWSLETTER</h1><p><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Sign up to find out when applications open, release dates, &amp; more!</li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212710/extras/9678f0cae875ce2bb71b0c2f207b1680.poster.avif?t=1668189427\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212710/extras/9678f0cae875ce2bb71b0c2f207b1680.webm?t=1668189427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212710/extras/9678f0cae875ce2bb71b0c2f207b1680.mp4?t=1668189427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">IWOCon\u2122 2 - A Sci-fi Convention</h2><br><br><strong>An unconventional indie game convention.</strong><br><br>Imagine an action shooter game where you can discover a galaxy of cool indie games because that is what IWOCon 2 is.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212710/extras/6b6e919f7f01974453cad7d930d0f5ab.poster.avif?t=1668189427\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212710/extras/6b6e919f7f01974453cad7d930d0f5ab.webm?t=1668189427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212710/extras/6b6e919f7f01974453cad7d930d0f5ab.mp4?t=1668189427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Free to play.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Sci-fi action shooting.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Custom avatars.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fly spaceships. Go zoom.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Exploration.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Loot.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Indie Games.</li></ul><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212710/extras/e5a1c77c7f1fce51b470ea0f6e0a0d2d.poster.avif?t=1668189427\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212710/extras/e5a1c77c7f1fce51b470ea0f6e0a0d2d.webm?t=1668189427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212710/extras/e5a1c77c7f1fce51b470ea0f6e0a0d2d.mp4?t=1668189427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Exploration</h2><br><br>You'll get to explore different cities, planets, &amp; space stations.<br><br>You'll also get to fly around fast spaceships, control drones, &amp; interact with NPCs.<br><br>Don't forget to customize your avatar plus collect a bunch of loot!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212710/extras/7ea25dc4b9a5e13ef8cd583cacd53c0e.poster.avif?t=1668189427\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212710/extras/7ea25dc4b9a5e13ef8cd583cacd53c0e.webm?t=1668189427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212710/extras/7ea25dc4b9a5e13ef8cd583cacd53c0e.mp4?t=1668189427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Free to Experience</h2><br><br>Can you imagine it? Well don't, coz that's what you get, and you get it for FREE!<br><br>Ultimately <strong>IWOCon\u2122</strong> ( pronounced <i>&quot;Eye-Woe-Con&quot;</i>) is all about YOU, the gamer, and satisfying your desire to play and find cool games.<br><br>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212710/extras/9678f0cae875ce2bb71b0c2f207b1680.poster.avif?t=1668189427\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212710/extras/9678f0cae875ce2bb71b0c2f207b1680.webm?t=1668189427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212710/extras/9678f0cae875ce2bb71b0c2f207b1680.mp4?t=1668189427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">IWOCon\u2122 2 - A Sci-fi Convention</h2><br><br><strong>An unconventional indie game convention.</strong><br><br>Imagine an action shooter game where you can discover a galaxy of cool indie games because that is what IWOCon 2 is.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212710/extras/6b6e919f7f01974453cad7d930d0f5ab.poster.avif?t=1668189427\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212710/extras/6b6e919f7f01974453cad7d930d0f5ab.webm?t=1668189427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212710/extras/6b6e919f7f01974453cad7d930d0f5ab.mp4?t=1668189427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Free to play.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Sci-fi action shooting.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Custom avatars.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fly spaceships. Go zoom.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Exploration.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Loot.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Indie Games.</li></ul><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212710/extras/e5a1c77c7f1fce51b470ea0f6e0a0d2d.poster.avif?t=1668189427\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212710/extras/e5a1c77c7f1fce51b470ea0f6e0a0d2d.webm?t=1668189427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212710/extras/e5a1c77c7f1fce51b470ea0f6e0a0d2d.mp4?t=1668189427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Exploration</h2><br><br>You'll get to explore different cities, planets, &amp; space stations.<br><br>You'll also get to fly around fast spaceships, control drones, &amp; interact with NPCs.<br><br>Don't forget to customize your avatar plus collect a bunch of loot!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212710/extras/7ea25dc4b9a5e13ef8cd583cacd53c0e.poster.avif?t=1668189427\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212710/extras/7ea25dc4b9a5e13ef8cd583cacd53c0e.webm?t=1668189427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212710/extras/7ea25dc4b9a5e13ef8cd583cacd53c0e.mp4?t=1668189427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Free to Experience</h2><br><br>Can you imagine it? Well don't, coz that's what you get, and you get it for FREE!<br><br>Ultimately <strong>IWOCon\u2122</strong> ( pronounced <i>&quot;Eye-Woe-Con&quot;</i>) is all about YOU, the gamer, and satisfying your desire to play and find cool games.<br><br>",
